  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya, Tanzania. Through the Exchange Climate Venture Builder, East African entrepreneurs will go to Norway to build sustainable business models, validate solutions and network with academia and industry. Meanwhile, Norwegian students will go to East Africa to immerse themselves in the East African innovation space and develop an accessible digital program curriculum. To build long-lasting support mechanisms, partner organizations in the south will establish themselves at the forefront of ESG policies in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
